* LT8710 Synchronous SEPIC Converter : 24 V IN -> 12 V / 1 A OUT
* -------------------------------------------------------------
* Vendor macro-model of the LT8710 multi-topology synchronous
* controller.  The GATE pin drives the ground-referenced power
* NMOS; the rectifier is a synchronous P-channel MOSFET with a
* level-shifting gate driver (plus a parallel Schottky for the
* dead-time / start-up path).
*
* Subckt pin order (as called below):
*  SYNC RT VC SS FBX IMON ISP ISN EN/FBIN VIN INTVCC GATE SENSE
*  GND SRVO_FB SRVO_IMON FLAG
* -------------------------------------------------------------
.lib LT8710.sub

*** Input source and input capacitors ***
VSRC IN 0 DC 24
CIN1 IN 0 22u Rser=15m
CIN2 IN 0 100n

*** Controller ***
XU1 SYNC RT VC SS FBX IMON ISP ISN EN IN INTVCC GATE SENSE 0
+   SRVO_FB SRVO_IMON FLAG LT8710

*** Enable / bias ***
REN1 IN EN 100k
REN2 EN 0 12.4k
CVCC INTVCC 0 4.7u
RSYNC SYNC 0 10k

*** Oscillator (~300 kHz) ***
RRT RT 0 41.2k

*** Soft-start and loop compensation ***
CSS SS 0 4.7n
RC1 VC VCX 10k
CC1 VCX 0 4.7n
CC2 VC 0 100p

*** Output voltage feedback : Vout = 1.6V*(1 + 64.9k/10k) = 12.0V ***
RFB1 OUT FBX 64.9k
RFB2 FBX 0 10k

*** Output current monitor / sense (limit set well above 1 A) ***
RIS OUTS OUT 1m
RISP ISP OUTS 10
RISN ISN OUT 10
CIS ISP ISN 1n
RIMON IMON 0 10k
CIMON IMON 0 100p

*** Status pin pull-ups (open-collector outputs) ***
RF1 FLAG INTVCC 100k
RF2 SRVO_FB INTVCC 100k
RF3 SRVO_IMON INTVCC 100k

*** SEPIC power stage ***
L1 IN SW 47u Rser=25m
CS SW A 4.7u Rser=5m
L2 A 0 47u Rser=25m
RG GATE G1 4.7
MN SW G1 SP 0 NMOSPWR
RSENSE SP 0 8m
RSNS SENSE SP 1
CSNS SENSE 0 100p

* Synchronous rectifier (P-channel) + level-shift gate driver
MP A PGATE OUTS OUTS PMOSPWR
BSYNC PGATE OUTS V = -10*limit(1-V(GATE)/3,0,1)
D1 A OUTS DSCH

* Snubbers
RSN1 SW SNA 10
CSN1 SNA 0 1n
RSN2 A SNB 10
CSN2 SNB 0 1n

*** Output capacitors and resistive load ***
COUT1 OUT 0 100u Rser=10m
COUT2 OUT 0 1u
RLOAD OUT 0 12

*** Device models ***
.model NMOSPWR NMOS(Vto=2.5 Kp=60 Lambda=0.005 Rd=20m Rs=5m Is=1e-14)
.model PMOSPWR PMOS(Vto=-2.5 Kp=40 Lambda=0.005 Rd=30m Rs=5m Is=1e-14)
.model DSCH D(Is=2e-5 Rs=20m N=1.05 Cjo=200p Vj=0.5 BV=60 Ibv=1m)

*** Analysis ***
.tran 0 5m 0 200n
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=4m TO=5m
.meas TRAN vout_ripple PP V(OUT) FROM=4.9m TO=5m
.options plotwinsize=0
.end
